min-evict-objects: MIN_EVICT_OBJECTS = 2

Classification: profile setting.

The number of persistent objects for which NV space is reserved is a profile
choice; version 185 raises it to 9, tpm-rs (like the public mstpm20 profile)
uses 2, which determines the reported TPM_PT_HR_PERSISTENT_MIN and how much
NV space remains for indices.
diff --git a/TPMCmd/TpmConfiguration/TpmConfiguration/TpmProfile_Misc.h b/TPMCmd/TpmConfiguration/TpmConfiguration/TpmProfile_Misc.h
--- a/TPMCmd/TpmConfiguration/TpmConfiguration/TpmProfile_Misc.h
+++ b/TPMCmd/TpmConfiguration/TpmConfiguration/TpmProfile_Misc.h
@@ -21,7 +21,7 @@
 #define MAX_LOADED_SESSIONS        3
 #define MAX_SESSION_NUM            3
 #define MAX_LOADED_OBJECTS         3
-#define MIN_EVICT_OBJECTS          9
+#define MIN_EVICT_OBJECTS          2
 #define NUM_POLICY_PCR_GROUP       1
 #define NUM_AUTHVALUE_PCR_GROUP    1
 #define MAX_CONTEXT_SIZE           2264
